<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT ESTONIA 4-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT ESTONIA 4-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
